    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "(4) This is the first time a DTMP is showed for (GE)CMV matrices. Some results in Baire category for certain classes of almost periodic extended CMV matrices were previously obtained by [27,41]. It is an open question whether it holds for other CMV matrices with, for example, subshift or Sturmian Verblunsky coefficients."
